  "details": "# Issue:\nIf you are fast enough to grab the Main Menu Move bar before it disappears after you pressed `Go` to join an Instance, you can just hold on to it. This results in you being able to move around the loading screen.\n# Expected Behaviour:\nThe Loading Screen should not be able to be moved around via the Main Menu Move bar. If it's not possible to detach these to from each other, pressing the go button / being in the loading screen should prohibit the moving of the Menu / deactivate that function.\n# Attachments:\nHere is a video showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/tnj7cx",
